    "description": "Closed Mentalism 3.4 - Mind's Door. Teleportation spells for the caster and inanimate objects, both direct (blocked by barriers) and through barriers (the Long Door family), plus cooperative teleportation with an intelligent target (Mind's Door). Special Notes: See Section 15.6 (p. 97) for notes on encumbrance limits for movement spells.",
    "spells": [
      {
        "name": "02. Leave Item I",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
        "system": {
          "favorite": false,
          "instant": false,
          "level": 2,
          "area_of_effect": "1 object",
          "duration": "—",
          "range": "50'",
          "type": "U",
          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Caster \"teleports\" a single inanimate object to a point up to 100' away from its current location. There can be no intervening barriers in a direct line between the target and the point (for these purposes, a barrier is anything the object could not physically go through). The object has a maximum weight limit of 1 pound per level of the caster."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "04. Long Door Item I",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
        "system": {
          "favorite": false,
          "instant": false,
          "level": 4,
          "area_of_effect": "1 object",
          "duration": "—",
          "range": "10'",
          "type": "U",
          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "As Leave Item I, except the object can pass through barriers by specifying exact direction and distance. If the arrival point coincides with solid or liquid material, the object does not move (though the caster loses the PPs)."
        }
      },
